# BusyBox options turned on over `make allnoconfig` (see the Makefile).
# A small shell first: ash with its built-in echo, test and printf, and
# arithmetic. Commands that are not built in need fork and exec, which the
# kernel does not offer yet.
CONFIG_ASH
CONFIG_SH_IS_ASH
CONFIG_ASH_ECHO
CONFIG_ASH_TEST
CONFIG_ASH_PRINTF
CONFIG_ASH_INTERNAL_GLOB
CONFIG_FEATURE_SH_MATH
CONFIG_FEATURE_SH_MATH_64
